From: Xios Project <xios@localhost>
Subject: [PATCH] desktop: use the concise Thunar launcher name

The desktop entry name becomes CFBundleDisplayName for Xios native launchers.
Keep SpringBoard and the desktop launcher consistent with the app's proper
name instead of the generic "Thunar File Manager" label.

--- a/thunar.desktop.in.in
+++ b/thunar.desktop.in.in
@@ -1,5 +1,5 @@
 [Desktop Entry]
-_Name=Thunar File Manager
+_Name=Thunar
 _Comment=Browse the filesystem with the file manager
 _GenericName=File Manager
 _Keywords=file manager;explorer;finder;browser;folders;directory;directories;partitions;drives;network;devices;rename;move;copy;delete;permissions;home;trash;
